    <Comment X="-380" Y="-260" Width="1100" Height="440" Text="Flipbook sprite: the sprite sheet's frame at this particle (its UVs are remapped to the frame per instance -- the Flipbook module), times the particle's colour (Vertex Color), twice as bright so Bloom catches the fireball. Opacity the sheet's alpha times the particle's." />
